rent energy-proxy receipt is AC-only and does not provide battery-mode or power-advantage proof. The swarm migration proof is now native tracker state: SWARM-LNL258V-REG-001/#29 merged as fb9db1577723a73682c63d49a3a6de893a2359cd, and tracker closeout #32 merged as f5acd924399b9d101fbc8936e70347bce11a3f75. A live telemetry-context --require-battery check on 2026-05-20 still reported AC power (BatteryStatus=2; EstimatedChargeRemaining=100; ac_power_inferred=true), so POWER-006 remains a physical battery-mode evidence blocker.",
